WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:55.240
Let's pray for our victory in tomorrow's semi-final against Brazil! Cheers!

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.590
Cheers!

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.140
A drink after a nice battle is especially tasty!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.930
Now let's fill our stomach in preparation for tomorrow's match!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.810
Oh boy, I just hope he won't eat too much.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:17.800
It's okay, I'm sure Takao can control himself...

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:20.740
What's wrong?

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:22.240
Geh!

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.920
Y-Y-Yummy! <i>Delicious!</i>

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.830
America's food is really on another level!

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.670
This guy...

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.220
Good grief.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.340
Yummy!

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.900
<i>Delicious!</i>

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:45.840
Semi-Final - Super High Speed Circuit!

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.530
What's taking Takao so long?

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.700
He's late, isn't he?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.590
He might not make it.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.210
Good grief.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.550
Hey...

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.600
Was that Takao's voice just now?

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.040
Hey...

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.170
Sorry for the wait...

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:15.750
What's wrong? It's time to register our team.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.230
T-Takao?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.760
What's with the gloomy faces?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.090
You know, I'm so looking forward to today's battles...

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:28.280
After all we're up against the Brazilian team who is said to be very strong...

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:31.620
My Dragoon here is looking forward to it too...

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.420
Uhm, Takao...

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:38.900
E-Excuse me... for a moment. Bathroom...

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:45.040
You got sick because you went and ate too much! And on the day of the semi-finals too!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:50.800
Not to mention that the American team has already advanced to the finals!

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:54.760
Mama's team made it to the finals, as expected.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:58.090
Takao can't fight the semi-finals.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.180
What should we do?

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:02.750
What are you saying, Professor? I can totally fight.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:03.620
But..!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:06.920
What?! You saying you can't trust me?!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.800
That's not it, but...

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.080
Then register me!

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.270
No, you're not fighting.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:17.520
In your current state, you'll hold the team back.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.730
W-What?! What about my skills?

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.900
Can you bring out your skills in that condition?

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.520
O-Of course I can!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:31.030
I can't let someone who's not in top form fight.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:33.120
But what about the match?

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:33.980
I'll go.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.930
Kai!

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:37.560
B-But I..!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.220
Ow! Bath... room...

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.790
Kai, thank you very much.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.440
Don't misunderstand, I...

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.940
Don't want to see the team fall here.
That's what you want to say, right? I get it.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.740
Kai-kun is going to fight today.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.840
Looks like the BBA team has
finally become a true team.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:21.170
Still, it's unexcusable. That fool Takao can't even take care of his own body.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:27.310
It's youth. When I was young,
I did some reckless stuff myself.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.980
Ah, I do have some memories of my reckless days too.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.090
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:43.410
Are you having fun?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.620
Yeah!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.900
It's the long-awaited second match of the semi-finals!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:55.500
The American team already advanced to the finals in the first match.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.620
Who will folllow them? The Brazilian team?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.840
Or will it be the BBA team?

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:12.840
Both teams are famous for their power. It's going to be one heck of a fight!

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:13.850
Yeah!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.720
I want to battle...

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.700
Bathroom!

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.580
First battle! For the Brazilian team,

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.680
Salvador!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:45.130
Salvador is a Samba dancer, one of the protagonists of the famous Carnival in Rio every year!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.980
His nickname is King of Dance!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.930
He's flashy alright.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:56.050
One of the protagonists of the Carnival in Rio, huh.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:58.040
I wonder how he fights.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.240
Maybe he's going to start dancing?

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:03.230
For the BBA team, Max!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.110
Max has defeated countless opponents with his rock solid defense.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.240
He's really the King of Defense!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.120
Don't exaggerate now, DJ.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.210
Mama...

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:25.150
Uh? Is that Max's mother up there?

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:28.080
So she came to see her son's match.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.470
The removal of our equipment
is going to take a while.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.840
I see. Then we can stay here
and observe this match.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:41.310
Even our mighty Director is worried about her son's match, huh.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.850
That's not it.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:50.040
The Brazilian team and BBA team. Whoever wins will be our opponent in the finals.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:53.950
Of course neither of them pose a threat to our team,

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.470
but the more data about your enemies, the better.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:57.680
That's all there is to it.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:59.040
I see.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.960
And here is the stadium for this battle!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.970
T-This..!

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:11.120
Oh? Is it a roller coaster?

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:14.720
Run across the vast continent of America!

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.770
It's the Highway Stadium!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:27.270
This stadium is based on the highway that spans to every corner of America!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:32.400
Live the American dream,
and run around the whole country!

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.610
Highway, huh.

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.120
Sounds cool.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:42.030
Alright, are you ready for the first battle?

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.120
Okay!

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.560
Three, Two, One!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:47.960
Go.. Shoot!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.260
Who will win this first battle?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.880
Will it be Max, the King of Defense?

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.880
Or Salvador, the King of Dance?

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.710
Yahoo!

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.850
<i>Let's dancing!</i>

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.740
What's going on?

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.560
It's just as I thought. He's dancing...

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:20.360
Yeah...

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:36.680
Oh? This is..!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.680
Music..?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:42.680
The Bey is an instrument!
This is the highest level of music!

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:45.870
My body is moving on its own!

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:51.570
Reminds me of my younger days. I made people scream with my elegant dancing.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.120
Same for me.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.860
Yeah right! I'm much better than you!

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.310
No, no, look at this!

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:08.830
Everybody is into it! This is the <i>sound of Beyblade</i>!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.350
The fun is only getting started!

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.720
Dancing Charge!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.400
Yahoo!

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.600
What?!

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.460
Draciel!

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:44.650
Dance like a hummingbird, strike like a condor! You can't run from my dancing crush!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:48.290
What an unpredictable attack!

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:51.300
At this rate, my Draciel won't make it!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:55.360
How can I counter that irregular attack?

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.840
Are you sure it's <i>really</i> irregular?

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:00.630
Kai!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.640
Yeah! Oh! Yeah!

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.640
Samba... Dance...

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.150
Ooh! Ah! Yoh!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:14.990
Rhythm... Rhythmical...

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:20.040
I got it! Salvador's attack isn't irregular at all!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.650
There's a rhythm to it!

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:23.040
Okay!

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:28.120
You're finished!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.620
Draciel!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.170
What?!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.560
<i>Once more!</i>

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.370
Oh? The two Beys look like they're dancing!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.060
Just like

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:48.050
a Dancing Carnival!

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:52.560
Why? How can you dodge my attacks?

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.480
Your attacks are too rhythmical.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:00.480
So once I have memorized the rhythm, dodging them is very easy!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.480
N-No way! Impossible!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.880
One more time! Dancing Charge!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.700
It's useless! I've already seen through your rhythm!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.990
Now, Draciel!

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:30.090
Salvador's Bey crashed!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.810
The winner of the first battle

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.760
is the BBA team!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.980
That Max really did it!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.120
That was a great dance!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.030
Great match, you two!

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:45.200
I'll improve my dance,
and next time I will defeat you!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.530
Let us meet again.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.080
I won, Mama!

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.300
I'll introduce the fighters of the second battle!

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:13.310
The BBA team sends Rei!

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:16.520
The Brazilian team sends Maura!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:21.020
What's with the fishing pole? Do you plan on <i>reeling in</i> your victory?

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:23.540
Well, something like that.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:25.690
That's no fishing pole!

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.800
It appears to be a special shooter!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.700
In place of the fishing line, there's a long winder.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:35.790
The speed of a Bey shot from such a long winder will be beyond measure!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.480
Okay, let's proceed with the second battle!

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.460
Three, Two, One!

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.160
Go...

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.630
Shoot!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.700
If you don't catch up to me soon, it won't be any fun.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:59.280
Or is it that your Bey can't keep up with my speed?

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:03.280
Catching up will be easy. Go, Driger!

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:06.200
So fast!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:11.120
Rei's Driger is catching up at incredible speed!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.330
Oh, was I going too fast?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.170
Don't make light of me! My Bey can..!

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:20.780
Not yet!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:30.000
Oh! The two Beyblades are
running along the highway!

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:33.090
This has truly become a Beyblade circuit!

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.380
Your speed isn't half bad.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.820
I trained my skills under the Amazons!

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:39.520
Amazons?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.400
I'm a fisher-woman born into the Amazon tribe!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.710
Go, Decoy Attack!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.550
Shadow clones?

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:53.910
This is a move I came up to rival the Amazons! Go!

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.500
How do you like my Decoy Attack?

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.170
35 points.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.310
Eh? What's up with that?!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.260
No matter how many times you multiply, the real you is only one!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.480
So you saw through it.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:13.600
Childish tricks like this don't work with me.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.880
Come at me head-on!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:21.930
Not bad.

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.160
You too.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:30.720
This is a super high-speed race on the circuit!

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.840
Avert your eyes and you'll miss out!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:34.630
It's like the F-1!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:36.920
I can gather all sorts of data!

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.600
Go, Rei!

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.780
Are you alright?

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:41.800
Yeah...

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:49.160
My blood is boiling! In my younger days, I made people scream with my sport car on the circuit.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.090
Me too. This sure brings back memories.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.050
Oh! Driger dashes ahead!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:07.350
I'm just getting started! Go, Piranha Attack!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:19.590
Oh! An attack from the air for Maura!

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:22.080
Your Bey will become food for the piranhas!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:29.880
Too easy! Driger won't fall for such an attack!

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:36.720
He dodged my Piranha Attack?!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.730
Driger vanished! Where did he go?

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:42.780
Where could he be hiding?! Come out!

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:46.740
He's not hiding at all. Driger is right next to you.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.270
No way..!

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:52.820
There's Driger! Wow!
He had already completed a lap!

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:56.810
He completed an entire lap
around America in mere seconds?!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:00.680
That's right. My Driger's speed is second to none.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:02.330
Go, Byakko!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.290
If I manage to land a hit now, I might have a chance!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.430
It's too late!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.360
I-Impossible!

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.730
This is my... Driger's speed.

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:37.550
It's over! The second battle is won by Rei!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.370
We did it!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.750
Rei! You did it...

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:52.250
With this, the BBA team advances to the finals before fighting the third battle!

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.160
The BBA team pretty good.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.990
I never thought they'd make it to the finals.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:59.920
It goes against my calculations.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:05.320
Oh? So even the Director who's like a computer makes mistakes every now and then.

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:07.180
Well, it happens.

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:12.480
The removal should be done by now. Let's go back.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.590
Won't you watch the last match?

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:16.550
We've seen enough already. Let's go.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:17.580
Ah, yes!

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.000
I fought with everything I had, and yet...

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:23.250
I lost.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:26.640
Do you feel frustrated?

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.120
No, I feel refreshed!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.290
That's how you feel when you fight with everything you've got.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.160
You're right.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.290
But still,

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:39.920
we were on a highway, but
I might have exceeded the speed limit.

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:42.310
Ahah! You're under arrest!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:45.390
I had a lot of fun. Let's do this again!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.570
You bet!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.170
Things are going fine...

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:55.720
Your condition is getting better with every victory.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:19:00.720
No matter happens now, tomorrow we'll fight the American team at the finals!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.540
What's wrong, Max?

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.960
Mama and Emily have left...

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:09.590
You can still catch them if you
hurry! Let's go after them!

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:12.380
But we have to support Kai...

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.080
You can leave that to Rei and me.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.210
But...

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:19.870
I have no need whatsoever for your support.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.480
If you want to go, just go.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:24.480
Kai! <i>Thank you!</i>

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:29.430
The Brazilian team wants to at least win the last battle, and for this they send out Mario!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.760
This is ironic.

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:38.490
We lost to the same BBA team I fought together with during the charity match...

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:42.410
But I won't lose! I will bring home one victory!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.030
The BBA team sends Kai!

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:50.410
Man, they're so naive.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.840
Okay, here we go with the third battle!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.720
Mama!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:05.990
Max.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:09.640
Mama! We made it to the finals!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.140
Congratulations.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:13.950
Uhm.. Thank you.

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:15.540
Anything else?

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:21.190
Mama! I will fight against your PPB team with everything I have!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.570
Look at me!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:31.520
Well, we'll see you tomorrow.
You'll see our true power.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.080
Yeah!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.560
Bring it on!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.650
Kai wins!

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:51.310
The semi-finals end with the
BBA team's consecutive victories!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:57.030
BBA team... They've gotten a lot stronger since the charity match.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.110
It's the result of our training!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:07.960
Tomorrow's final round of the American tournament will be the clash between the American team and the BBA team!

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:14.520
To cheer for both teams, let's shout together!

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:17.230
Three, Two, One!

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:20.630
Go... Shoot!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.050
Let's go, Max.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:22.860
Yeah!

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.520
Here it comes again...

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:31.480
B-Bathroom!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.250 --> 00:23:04.870
According to my analysis, the best formation for the finals is: Takao, Rei, Kai.

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:09.210
But Max wants to fight at all costs, and he won't listen to reason!

00:23:09.210 --> 00:23:12.790
What's happening? He's usually such a good boy.

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:16.340
It must have to do with the
trouble concerning his mother.

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:19.950
Next time: Clash! The American Tournament Finals.

00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:24.440
Oh! It looks like Takao is having
problems of his own with Steve!
